Place KITTI .bin and .txt files here.

Download from: http://www.cvlibs.net/datasets/kitti/

Example files:
- 000001.bin  (point cloud, ~1.8MB)
- 000001.txt  (labels, ~1KB)

Or generate synthetic data:
```python
import numpy as np
points = np.random.randn(120000, 4).astype(np.float32)
points.tofile('demo.bin')
```
